\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   Father, who on man dost shower
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Gifts of plenty from Thy dower,
\par To Thy people give the power
\par All Thy gifts to use alright.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Give pure happiness in leisure,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Temperance in every pleasure,
\par Holy use of earthly treasure,
\par Bodies clear and spirits bright.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Lift from this and every nation
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 All that brings us degradation;
\par Quell the forces of temptation;
\par Put Thine enemies to flight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Be with us, Thy strength supplying,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 That with energy undying,
\par Every foe of man defying,
\par We may rally to the fight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thou who art our Captain ever,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Lead us on to great endeavour;
\par May Thy Church the world deliver:
\par Give us wisdom, courage, might.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Father, who hast sought and found us,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Son of God, whose love has bound us,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Holy Ghost, within us, round us -
\par \pard      Hear us, Godhead infinite.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

